# AlcedoStudio's root .gitignore has generic `csrc/` and `*build-*` rules that
# also match this vendored snapshot. Everything below is source required by
# crates/x3f-sys/build.rs (bindgen headers + the two compiled C shims), the
# pinned dependency lock, and the xcframework build helper -- keep them tracked
# so a fresh clone can build the vendored crates without regeneration.
!Cargo.lock
!crates/x3f-sys/csrc/
!crates/x3f-sys/csrc/**
!crates/x3f-ffi-c/scripts/build-xcframework.sh